cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "campaign-readout-pipeline: campaign incrementality readouts that are published only when their preconditions hold"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ribeiro
    given-names: Diogo
    email: dfr@esmad.ipp.pt
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-2022-7072"
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/DiogoRibeiro7/campaign-readout-pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A pipeline that estimates what a marketing campaign added to sales, and
  publishes the estimate only when a set of conditions declared in advance
  holds. When one does not hold it publishes a refusal that names it.
keywords:
  - causal inference
  - incrementality
  - marketing measurement
  - propensity score
  - placebo test
  - bootstrap
  - reproducible research
